[2026-06-02 18:41:18] 2. Grundfos Holding A/S
[2026-06-02 18:41:18] Company Introduction
[2026-06-02 18:41:18] Grundfos is a global leader in advanced pump solutions and a trendsetter in water technology. Founded in 1945 in Denmark, the company has grown to become a multinational corporation with a presence in more than 56 countries. Grundfos is committed to sustainable development and aims to solve water - related challenges around the world. In the field of plunger pumps, Grundfos has a long - standing reputation for innovation and quality.
